      "totalDuration": "3 yrs 4 mos",
      "description": "- Maintained the ML pipeline on Azure Data Factory\n- Built a phish URL dashboard to analyze the phish URL list/URL metrics, in collaboration with data scientists \n- Led a small team to ship two custom features by designing from front-end to back-end:\n    - Implemented the client-side REST API to read the company logo and its background color\n    - Designed and built to save customized notification messages, translate them into localized languages with Microsoft Translator API, and render them during the run-time with a low latency\n- Implemented extendable features on the email pipeline. It allows O365 to:\n    - Filters out an attack based on other customer features like regions, IP, and languages\n    - Blocks encrypted malware attachment\n- Designed a feature from data publishing script to Web Service API that drives the increase of premium service activation on the M365 admin portal:  30% increase since the release\n- Led the cross-team effort of measuring the MAU of the service with redacted customer data from the data mining to dashboard.",
